  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Suggestion:\nRight now, there is no real way to move the mirror closer or further away from where you are. I think adding a way to do this might be helpful if you, for example, are in a bigger group. You could maybe allow us to move it closer / further away with our left thumb stick when holding the mirror. (Up moves it away, down moves it closer)\n\nEdit: We can already do that in desktop with the scroll wheel, so why not allow use to do that in VR as well ^^",
